Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.07,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(924,0)\frz270\bord0\pos(460,280)}『沸血咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.07,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(924,0)\frz270\bord0.8\blur12\1a&HFF&\3c&H836369&\pos(460,600)}鬼狼狂宴』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.07,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(924,0)\frz270\bord0\alpha&H255&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(460,600)}鬼{\c&HD1B5B8&}狼{\c&HB28586&}狂{\c&HE99FA8&}宴』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:40.13,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(546,0)\frz270\bord0.3\blur10\1a&HFF&\3c&H4186DA&\pos(555,187)}『天狼寶匣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.34,0:23:40.13,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(546,0)\frz270\bord0.3\blur10\1a&HFF&\3c&H6EE9FD&\pos(555,512)}希望弧光』
